    <briefdescription>
<para>Internal QSGNode responsible for rendering the plot grid into the scene graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Draws grid lines at the tick values from <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1AxisTickPainter_1aa8dd989ea1edb1442179ac87ac00bb5c" kindref="member">AxisTickPainter::computeTickValues()</ref></computeroutput>, the same values the axis places its tick marks at, so both stay aligned under all zoom levels, including log scale.</para>
<para>Keeps two child geometry nodes, sub-grid first and main grid second, for its whole lifetime and updates them in place. A hidden layer keeps its node with no vertices. Adding or removing nodes would make the Qt Quick renderer rebuild all batches and re-upload every series&apos; vertex data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
